 open to the general public.\\nPatient advocates are welcome to attend scientific sessions.\\nKey Dates\\nMarch 1, 2027\\nAbstract submission deadline\\nGrant application deadline\\nMay 3, 2027\\nEarly registration deadline\\nMay 6, 2027\\nLate-breaking abstract submission deadline\\nJune 10-13, 2027\\nEHA2027 Congress in Barcelona, Spain\\nLatest information on EHA2027\\nEHA2027 registration\\nEHA2027 program\\nEHA2027 abstract submission\\nEHA2027 travel grants & abstract awards\\nEHA2027 sponsorship opportunities\\nEHA2027 details and deadlines\\nEHA2027 sustainability\\nCongress Archive\\nEHA2026 Congress Library\\nFuture Congresses\\nSponsor EHA2027\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-cadb8bc3ab6b0c81b9da0eab\", \"title\": \"2025 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)2025 winners - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3937, \"end\": 3993, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 56}, {\"start\": 4098, \"end\": 5642, \"excerpt_start\": 57, \"excerpt_end\": 1601}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"Left Sidebar\\n11 min read · May 6, 2025\\nMay 6, 2025\\nShare\\n2025 winners\\nJunior Research Grant\\nMaria Jassinskaja, Lund University, Sweden\\nTopic: Rejuvenating aged hematopoiesis via modulation of the bone marrow niche\\nVanessa Katia Favasuli, Candiolo Cancer Institute, Fondazione del Piemonte per l’Oncologia, Italy\\nTopic: Decoding the biologic and therapeutic roles of lncRNAs in multiple myeloma\\nSrdjan Grusanovic, Institute of Molecular Genetics of the Czech Academy of Sciences, Czechia\\nTopic: Effects of chronic inflammation on hematopoietic stem cell aging and response to infection\\nAdvanced Research Grant\\nNisha Narayan, University of Cambridge, United Kingdom\\nTopic: Clonal tracing to assess leukaemia stem cell heterogeneity and mechanisms of therapy resistance in acute myeloid leukaemia\\nAnastasia Conti, Fondazione Telethon ETS, Italy\\nTopic: Transposable element reactivation